      <title>An introduction to jQuery Mobile</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Smalltalk Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An overview of jQueryMobile, how it allows rapid development of mobile sites and some of the key pitfalls to be avoided. Examples showing how Seaside&amp;#39;s component model and #show/#answer facilities map well onto a mobile site. What it takes to turn a mobile web application into a mobile application suitable for a mobile app store.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
